              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Pike and hand weapon. May have light armour (+1 pt). Medieval Phalanx. Stubborn. On the turn they charge, Pikemen receive up to a maximum of +2 rank bonus; up to +3 in subsequent rounds of combat or if charged. (Armies of Chivalry p.39)</characteristic>
