  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="8e75-b1c0-e5b9-4b0f" name="The Low Countries (Armies of Chivalry) - List Notes" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false">
      <description>THE LOW COUNTRIES early 14th to late 15th century (Armies of Chivalry, pp.38-39).

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[The Low Countries]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 75%, at least 50%
  Characters 0-25%, Cavalry 0-25%, Infantry 50-75% (special units are purchased from the Infantry allocation). Mercenaries: 0-1 unit of English Veteran Longbowmen or Trained Archers from the HYW English list (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
